<title>USA: Thiokol Corp raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Thiokol Corp raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>OGDEN, Utah 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.20		     $0.17</p>
<p> Pay		   June 13</p>
<p> Record		 May 30</p>
<p>NOTE: Cash payment of $0.20 includes a $0.19 quarterly dividend and $0.01 for the reedemption of each right issued to stockholders in February 1989.</p>
<p>The company expects to declare a $0.20 dividend in the next quarter.</p>
</text>
